        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-use-mt5-expert-advisors-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">UpForex 的外汇和差价合约页面指出，其平台支持自动化策略的 EA 交易。读者可以查看</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">支持智能交易自动交易的经纪商</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">，并使用</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"6\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"7\">最佳外汇经纪商MetaTrader 5</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"8\">指南作为经纪商选择清单。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc9c8a2f8aae55fec",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is an Expert Advisor in MT5?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-use-mt5-expert-advisors-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-use-mt5-expert-advisors-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">MT5 中的 EA 交易是什么？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0cfc0e39d7493535",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">An Expert Advisor is an MQL5 application that runs inside MetaTrader 5. It can analyse market conditions, generate alerts, manage positions, or execute trades according to programmed rules. An EA follows its code; it does not understand events or make human judgements beyond those instructions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-use-mt5-expert-advisors-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-use-mt5-expert-advisors-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">EA 交易是一个在 MetaTrader 5 内运行的 MQL5 应用程序。它可以分析市场状况、生成警报、管理头寸或根据编程规则执行交易。 EA 遵循其代码；它无法理解事件或做出超出这些指令的人类判断。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t86a9f08ae7ec9a16",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is it safe to use EAs as a beginner?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-use-mt5-expert-advisors-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-use-mt5-expert-advisors-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">初学者使用 EA 安全吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t97778a7c6db71858",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Beginners can first review</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">a complete beginner’s guide to forex trading</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> before applying technical-analysis signals to live markets.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">初学者可以先查看</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">完整的外汇交易初学者指南</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">，然后再将技术分析信号应用于实时市场。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t77db7d8eefe19c1c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Candlestick Pattern?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是烛台形态？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t96dd7b10d011625e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Open:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> The starting price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">开盘价：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">起始价</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t271be859e2fa53d3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Close:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> The ending price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">收盘价：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">结束价格</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc123e4e6daa4dcfa",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The thick section is the </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">body</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">. The thin lines above and below it are </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">wicks</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> or </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\">shadows</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"6\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">粗的部分称为</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">实体</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">。其上方和下方的细线是</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">烛芯</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">，也称为</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\">影线</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"6\">。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t91d06e7747efa23f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A bullish candle closes above its opening price and is commonly green or white. A bearish candle closes below its opening price and is commonly red or black. Colours vary by platform, so the relationship between the open, close, body, and wicks matters more than colour.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">阳线的收盘价高于开盘价，通常为绿色或白色。阴线的收盘价低于开盘价，通常为红色或黑色。颜色因平台而异，因此开盘价、收盘价、实体及影线之间的关系比颜色更重要。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t99c5a06ef503fe22",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Do You Read a Candlestick Chart?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如何解读蜡烛图？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tddfee0f04987af06",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Next, read the body and wicks. A long bullish body suggests stronger buying pressure, while a long bearish body suggests stronger selling pressure. A small body can indicate hesitation. A long upper wick shows rejection of higher prices, while a long lower wick shows rejection of lower prices.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">接下来，观察实体和影线。较长的阳线实体表明买方压力较强，较长的阴线实体表明卖方压力较强。较小的实体可能表示犹豫。较长的上影线表明高价遭到拒绝，较长的下影线表明低价遭到拒绝。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t33831b53dc42ea2b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is the market trending or ranging?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">市场是趋势型还是区间型？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbdd80312c41f3da0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is the pattern near support or resistance?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">该形态是否接近支撑位或阻力位？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4325bee3ae77b29b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Single Candlestick Patterns</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">单烛台模式</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8c524ec5ed0febb5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Doji</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">十字星</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t06dcfba470867da8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">doji</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> forms when the opening and closing prices are equal or very close, creating a tiny body with possible upper and lower wicks. It represents indecision because neither buyers nor sellers maintained control by the close.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">十字星</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">在开盘价与收盘价相同或非常接近时形成，实体很小，并可能带有上下影线。它表示市场犹豫，因为买方和卖方在收盘时均未能保持主导。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td8cb4c72df7552ba",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">After a strong trend, a doji may signal slowing momentum, but it does not confirm a reversal. Traders usually wait for the next candle or a break of market structure.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/candlestick-patterns-how-to-read-charts"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在强劲趋势之后，十字星可能预示着势头放缓，但它并不确认逆转。交易者通常会等待下一根蜡烛或市场结构的突破。</span>"
    }
  ]
}
